ortant; text-indent:revert!important; text-orientation:revert!important; text-overflow:revert!important; text-transform:revert!important; top:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; visibility:revert!important; white-space:revert!important; width:revert!important; word-break:revert!important; word-spacing:revert!important; writing-mode:revert!important; zoom:revert!important; width:75px!important; background-color:#EAEAEA!important; padding:7px 5px 7px 5px!important; font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,Segoe UI,Segoe WP,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif!important; font-size:12px!important; font-weight:normal!important; color:#212121!important; text-align:left!important; word-wrap:break-word!important\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hi </span><span style=\"color:black\">Hokyun</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">It was a pleasure working with you. I’m glad I was able to help with what happened</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I just wanted&nbsp;to point out that you may receive an invitation from Microsoft to give feedback. Your feedback is very important for us so we can be better in the future and deliver the best customer support experience possible.&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><b>I would appreciate if you can take 1 to 2 minutes of your time to complete this feedback.</b></span></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">In that case, and as per your&nbsp;suggestion, this support request will now be closed.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">If you&nbsp;have further&nbsp;problems within the scope of this issue, please reply to this email or contact me or my manager using the contact information in my signature, and I will gladly continue working with you and reopen the case.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Below is a summary of the support request for your records:</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>Symptom:</b></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; line-height:20px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">After a Service Health event occurred on the target Redis resource, its current status is Unavailable. Customer want us to check the cause and advise on the appropriate resolution steps</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Calibri,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:black\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>Resolution:</b></div><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; line-height:20px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">There was an outage at the time, which was traced to an issue with the Software Load Balancer (SLB) affecting inbound VIP availability in Korea Central.</span></p><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">The issue has now been mitigated, and I can see that customer connections have returned to normal.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Regarding the RCA, it may take some time to provide and asked customer if they required a formal RCA or if the information shared was sufficient.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-Customer mentioned information was sufficient and agreed to close case.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction:ltr; text-align:left; text-indent:0px; line-height:20px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Calibri; font-size:11pt; color:black\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt;